# Data Security

Mandatory:
- preserve tenant isolation on all tenant-owned operations
- avoid logging secrets, tokens, sensitive payloads, or internal identifiers without need
- apply least-privilege and scoped access assumptions
- keep external integrations scoped and validated

Treat data leakage and cross-tenant exposure as critical severity.
